                            {
                                "example_id": "b648e0ce-6460-4782-8b2e-d338ed135361",
                                "sense_id": "dab44da8-238b-3c48-b3b7-a9551554ee08",
                                "text": "when he was disposed to pass into Achaia"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "186fb356-9bbc-4f7a-81ae-208a95f0737e",
                                "sense_id": "dab44da8-238b-3c48-b3b7-a9551554ee08",
                                "text": "Carried somehow, somewhither, for some reason, on these surging floods, were these travelers,[…]. Even such a boat as the Mount Vernon offered a total deck space so cramped as to leave secrecy or privacy well out of the question, even had the motley and democratic assemblage of passengers been disposed to accord either."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b1c781ff-c9c6-48d8-bf69-e141d13a6328",
                                "sense_id": "dab44da8-238b-3c48-b3b7-a9551554ee08",
                                "text": "Shortly afterwards the North Eastern Railway made overtures for the purchase of the Blyth & Tyne system, and the directors of the latter were then disposed to sell, but, in view of their excellent dividend record, stood out for a good price."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
